  description: "Forged in honor of the legendary r\u014Dnin Miyamoto Musashi, this
    iron-and-steel cuirass bears golden symbols of courage, wisdom, loyalty, and
    discipline. Crimson bindings represent the blood and sacrifice of the warrior\u2019s
    path, while subtle green details symbolize endurance and renewal. Though not
    a relic of Musashi himself, the armor was crafted to honor the principles associated
    with his legendary life \u2014 strength guided by wisdom, and victory achieved
    through mastery of oneself."
